#: ../../source/users/element/collection/what_is.rst:5
msgid "What is a collection?"
msgstr "什么是集合？"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/what_is.rst:7
msgid ""
"An element collection is a database where all element files are storaged and"
" classified. The element collection gives the information about the element "
"name, category (folder); sub-categories (sub-folders) and category or sub-"
"category path in the file system."
msgstr ""
"元件集合是一个用于存储和分类所有元件文件的数据库。元件集合提供有关元件名称、类别（文件夹）、子类别（子文件夹）以及类别或子类别在文件系统中的路径的信息。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/what_is.rst:11
msgid ""
"QElectroTech has two different element collections integrated, `QET "
"collection`_ and `User collection`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 集成了两种不同的元件集合：`QET 集合 <QET collection_>`_ 和 `用户集合 <User "
"collection_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/what_is.rst:16
msgid "Figure: Collection panel"
msgstr "图：集合面板"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/what_is.rst:18
msgid ""
"QElectroTech displays also a third collection in the `collections panel`_ "
"when a project is opened, the `project collection`_. This collection is not "
"part from the software structure and it is treated automatically by "
"QElectroTech during the draw process in the `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"当项目打开时，QElectroTech 还会在 `集合面板 <collections panel_>`_ 中显示第三种集合，即 `项目集合 "
"<project collection_>`_。该集合不属于软件结构的一部分，在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的绘图过程中由 "
"QElectroTech 自动处理。"
